  m_text: 'Score points while the player stays in the air.


    <b>CONTROLS</b>


    Arrow
    Keys: move from tower to tower


    Space: jump


    Double Space: long jump


    Esc:
    pause / music ON-OFF


    <b>RULES</b>


    Return to the start building to
    complete the level


    Booster buildings give you a triple jump


    Buildings
    collapse if you stay on them too long


    Finish the level before the TAX reaches
    0


    The remaining TAX is subtracted from your score


    Touching the ground
    costs one life

'
